  "details": "So we used to have a mod that had a leash and we could drag someone around and I used to use if for when I would fall asleep in a public world by accident and my friends would move me to a private so I could sleep peacefully and you could even follow them after they left the instance so if I was already asleep they wouldn’t have to wake me up if really appreciate if this would be added to the game you already promised the portable mirror which made my day 🙏🏻 But lmk because I fall asleep in vrc a lot because my friends have different time zones so it’s hard to spend time with them all and not fall asleep ;-;",
